<title>JAPAN: Mitsui Petrochem, Mitsui Toatsu announce merger.</title>
<headline>Mitsui Petrochem, Mitsui Toatsu announce merger.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mitsui Petrochemical Industries Ltd and Mitsui Toatsu Chemicals Inc on Monday officially announced plans to merge on October 1, 1997, in a move that would create the second-largest chemical producer in Japan.</p>
<p>The new company will be named Mitsui Chemicals Inc. They said Mitsui Toatsu would be dissolved on the merger and one Mitsui Petrochemical share would be exchanged for every 0.6 Mitsui Toatsu share.</p>
</text>
